@startuml
title Support workflow и escalation

actor "Клиент" as Client
actor "Менеджер" as Manager
participant "telegram-webhook" as Webhook
database "process_incoming_telegram_message" as IncomingRpc
participant "ai-orchestrator" as AI
database "publish_chat_ai_response" as PublishRpc
database "chats" as Chats
database "chat_assignments" as Assignment
database "assignment_history" as AssignmentHistory
database "chat_status_history" as StatusHistory
participant "support-admin Server Actions" as Actions
database "workflow RPC" as WorkflowRpc

Client -> Webhook: client message
Webhook -> IncomingRpc: persist
IncomingRpc -> Chats: create/update status open + last_message_at
Webhook -> AI: invoke

alt AI может ответить или уточнить
  AI -> PublishRpc: response_kind answer/clarify/intent_reply
  PublishRpc -> Chats: сохранить AI-eligible status
else AI handoff
  AI -> PublishRpc: response_kind handoff
  PublishRpc -> Chats: status = waiting_operator
  PublishRpc -> Assignment: очистить current assignment
  PublishRpc -> StatusHistory: open/in_progress -> waiting_operator
end

Manager -> Actions: взять чат в работу
Actions -> WorkflowRpc: take_chat_into_work
WorkflowRpc -> Assignment: set current_manager_id
WorkflowRpc -> AssignmentHistory: append assignment event
WorkflowRpc -> Chats: status = in_progress
WorkflowRpc -> StatusHistory: append status event

Manager -> Actions: transfer/status/resolve/delete/read/send
Actions -> WorkflowRpc: transfer_chat / update_chat_status / resolve_chat / delete_* / mark_chat_as_read / process_manager_outcoming_message
WorkflowRpc -> Chats: mutate workflow/read timestamps
WorkflowRpc -> Assignment: current assignment state
WorkflowRpc -> AssignmentHistory: assignment audit
WorkflowRpc -> StatusHistory: lifecycle audit

@enduml
